    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature attempts to cast a spell or use an ability has the Mental trait or would control or otherwise influence you.</p><p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are aware of the creature's attempt.</p><p><strong>Frequency</strong> Once per day</p><hr><p><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You repel a direct attempt at trying to influence you. You gain a +2 circumstance bonus to any saving throws you make, and if the effect is an area that includes you, any other creature making the saving throw also gains this benefit. If you roll a success on your saving throw, you critically succeed instead.</span></p>"
